    "title": "Project Manager (Information Technology Specialist II)",
    "excerpt": "<p>Are you passionate about technical project management? ODI is looking for a project manager to oversee critical projects and initiatives. You will be responsible for planning, organizing, and directing projects, ensuring project deliverables, managing resources, and overseeing communication with stakeholders, the team, executive management and control agencies. Location: The employee’s workstation is located in Sacramento, &#8230; <a title=\"Project Manager (Information Technology Specialist II)\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/join-us/project-manager-information-technology-specialist-ii/\" aria-label=\"More on Project Manager (Information Technology Specialist II)\">Read more</a></p>\n",
